# One-way pull of Gmail All Mail into a local Maildir with mbsync (isync).
# Put in ~/.mbsyncrc. Run: mbsync gmail-archive
# Creates the Maildir if missing. Never pushes changes to Gmail.

IMAPAccount gmail
Host imap.gmail.com
Port 993
User you@gmail.com
PassCmd "cat ~/.secrets/gmail-app.pw"
TLSType IMAPS
PipelineDepth 10

IMAPStore gmail-remote
Account gmail

MaildirStore gmail-local
Path ~/mail-archive/gmail/you@gmail.com/
Inbox ~/mail-archive/gmail/you@gmail.com/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel gmail-archive
Far :gmail-remote:"[Gmail]/All Mail"
Near :gmail-local:"All Mail"
Create Near
Expunge None
Remove None
Sync Pull
SyncState *
